.SH NOTES
With no account operand, membership comes from the process credentials. With
an account operand, membership comes from recorded account data. Automatically
supplied token groups can therefore appear only in the first view. Groups
without numeric projections and group attributes cannot be represented by
either numeric list.
.PP
Unresolved group names can be printed numerically while the command reports a
failure status. Inspect diagnostics as well as printed rows.
